(FLW-22 (undocumented precision - see Discrepancy 3): the loop variable
 outlives the loop. After the range form it holds end+1 (the value that
 failed the test); after the list form it holds the LAST element. The
 manual scopes `the number` to "inside the loop" (LANGUAGE.md:2206-2207)
 and says nothing about reading it afterwards.
